    EDIT 1
    BURN 0.0 (*DAYS*)
    MIX 2 (*COMBUSTIBLE MOX*) NOEV
    MIX 3 (*COMBUSTIBLE MOX*) NOEV
    MIX 4 (*COMBUSTIBLE MOX*) NOEV
    MIX 5 (*COMBUSTIBLE MOX*) NOEV
